#import "/_lib/0.1.1.typ": *
#show: template

// #taxon[Taxon]
// #title[Title]

Define an $F_(X,p)$-structure on a finite set to be a way of making that set into a field $k$ of characteristic $p$ and then choose an element of $X(k)$. 
$
  F_(X,p)(S) :-= sum (k : "FieldOfChar(p)"), (U(k) ~= S) xx X(k)
$
